cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the pre-flight check, please cite it as below."
title: "FairPath: fairness-aware early warning for student success"
abstract: >
  A reproducible pipeline and decision-support dashboard for student-success prediction that
  audits group fairness with uncertainty, compares pre-, in- and post-processing mitigation, and
  provides a pre-flight check for whether mitigation is measurable on a given dataset. Based on
  the undergraduate thesis "Investigating Algorithmic Bias in Student Success Prediction Models:
  A Comparative Study" (Gannan Normal University, 2026).
